(KEY-73 — `version` is contextual: claimed in the `Library <name> version
 "…"` and `see <lib> version "…"` headers, an ordinary identifier
 everywhere else. This probe carries the ordinary-identifier half only,
 because the header half needs a companion .lib/.so pair and a fixed
 compile-time working directory, which the probe runner does not guarantee.
 The header half is hand-verified in fixtures/kwlib.vox + fixtures/user.vox
 — see the ledger's Probes section for the exact commands and output.
